{
 "slug": "estudo-de-caso/inferir",
 "modulo": "estudo-de-caso",
 "tipo": "caso",
 "titulo": "Estudo de caso: testes de proporção e regressão das reclamações",
 "nav": "Inferir: testes e regressão",
 "sobretitulo": "Estudo de caso · dados abertos da ANAC",
 "descricao": "O que faz: testa se a proporção de chegadas com mais de 15 minutos de atraso difere entre as companhias (qui-quadrado de independência) e compara os pares…",
 "origem": {
  "material": "Estudo de caso ANAC",
  "trecho": "seções 8 e 9"
 },
 "html": "<h2 id=\"secao-8\">8. Pontualidade entre companhias: testes de proporções</h2>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> testa se a proporção de chegadas com mais de 15 minutos de atraso difere entre as companhias (qui-quadrado de independência) e compara os pares (teste z de duas proporções, com correção de Bonferroni), com o tamanho de efeito <em>h</em> de Cohen.</p>\n<p><strong>Quando usar:</strong> sempre que a pergunta é \"esta taxa é diferente daquela?\". Com milhões de voos, o ponto principal é o tamanho de efeito: quase qualquer diferença dá p-valor minúsculo.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">cont = <span class=\"tk-fn\">q</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'''</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    SELECT e.empresa, count(*) FILTER (WHERE atraso_chegada_min &gt; 15) AS atrasados,</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\"><span class=\"tk-str\">           count(*) FILTER (WHERE atraso_chegada_min &lt;= 15) AS no_horario</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    FROM fato_voo JOIN dim_empresa AS e USING (empresa_icao)</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\"><span class=\"tk-str\">    WHERE atraso_chegada_min IS NOT NULL GROUP BY ALL ORDER BY e.empresa</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\"><span class=\"tk-str\">'''</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">set_index</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">empresa</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">qui2, p_qui2, gl, _ = stats.<span class=\"tk-fn\">chi2_contingency</span>(cont)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">n_total = cont.<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_numpy</span>().<span class=\"tk-fn\">sum</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">v_cramer = np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">sqrt</span>(qui2 / (n_total * (<span class=\"tk-bi\">min</span>(cont.shape) - <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>)))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\"><span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">qui-quadrado = </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span><span class=\"tk-fn\">br</span>(qui2, <span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>)<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">, gl = </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>gl<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">, p = </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>p_qui2<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.1e</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">, V de Cramér = </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>v_cramer<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.3f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\"></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">pares = []</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> a, b <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> [(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Azul</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Gol</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>), (<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Azul</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">LATAM</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>), (<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Gol</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">LATAM</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)]:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\">    x = cont.loc[[a, b], <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">atrasados</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_numpy</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\">    n = cont.loc[[a, b]].<span class=\"tk-fn\">sum</span>(axis=<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>).<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_numpy</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\">    z, p = <span class=\"tk-fn\">proportions_ztest</span>(x, n)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"17\">    pa, pb = x / n</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"18\">    erro = np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">sqrt</span>(pa * (<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span> - pa) / n[<span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>] + pb * (<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span> - pb) / n[<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>])</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"19\">    h = <span class=\"tk-num\">2</span> * np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">arcsin</span>(np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">sqrt</span>(pa)) - <span class=\"tk-num\">2</span> * np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">arcsin</span>(np.<span class=\"tk-fn\">sqrt</span>(pb))</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"20\">    pares.<span class=\"tk-fn\">append</span>({<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">par</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>a<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\"> − </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>b<span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">diferenca_pp</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-num\">100</span> * (pa - pb),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"21\">                  <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ic95_inf_pp</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-num\">100</span> * (pa - pb - <span class=\"tk-num\">1.96</span> * erro), <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ic95_sup_pp</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-num\">100</span> * (pa - pb + <span class=\"tk-num\">1.96</span> * erro),</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"22\">                  <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">p_bonferroni</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-bi\">min</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">3</span> * p), <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">h_de_cohen</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: h})</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"23\">pares = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">DataFrame</span>(pares)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"24\"><span class=\"tk-fn\">tabela</span>(pares.<span class=\"tk-fn\">assign</span>(p_bonferroni=pares.p_bonferroni.<span class=\"tk-fn\">map</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">lambda</span> p: <span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>p<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.1e</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)), <span class=\"tk-num\">3</span>)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">qui-quadrado = 999, gl = 2, p = 1.3e-217, V de Cramér = 0.019</pre><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">par</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">diferenca_pp</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">ic95_inf_pp</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">ic95_sup_pp</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">p_bonferroni</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">h_de_cohen</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">0</th>\n<td>Azul − Gol</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0,858</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0,964</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0,752</td>\n<td>1.5e-56</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0,024</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">1</th>\n<td>Azul − LATAM</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-1,645</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-1,747</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-1,542</td>\n<td>2.0e-218</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0,046</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">2</th>\n<td>Gol − LATAM</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0,787</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0,897</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0,676</td>\n<td>1.8e-43</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0,022</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div></div>\n<aside class=\"callout callout--atencao\"><p class=\"callout__titulo callout__titulo--so-icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3\"></path><path d=\"M12 9v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"></path></svg><span class=\"sr-only\">Atenção</span></p><div class=\"callout__corpo\"><p><strong>O que observar:</strong> todas as diferenças são \"estatisticamente significativas\", e todas são <strong>pequenas</strong>: |<em>h</em>| abaixo de 0,05, quando 0,2 é o limite convencional de um efeito pequeno, e V de Cramér perto de zero. No agregado do período, as três companhias têm praticamente a mesma pontualidade; o que muda é a trajetória de cada uma ao longo do tempo (seção 5.3).</p></div></aside>\n<h2 id=\"secao-9\">9. Regressão: reclamações × atraso e cancelamento</h2>\n<h3 id=\"secao-9-1\">9.1 A relação nos dados</h3>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> cada ponto é uma companhia em um mês (108 pontos: 3 companhias × 36 meses).</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">fig, (ax1, ax2) = plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">subplots</span>(<span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>, figsize=(<span class=\"tk-num\">12</span>, <span class=\"tk-num\">4.8</span>), sharey=<span class=\"tk-kw\">True</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> emp <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> EMPRESAS:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">    d = painel[painel.empresa == emp]</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">    ax1.<span class=\"tk-fn\">scatter</span>(d.pct_atraso15_chegada, d.reclamacoes_100k, color=CORES[emp], s=<span class=\"tk-num\">28</span>, alpha=<span class=\"tk-num\">0.85</span>, label=emp)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">    ax2.<span class=\"tk-fn\">scatter</span>(d.pct_cancelados, d.reclamacoes_100k, color=CORES[emp], s=<span class=\"tk-num\">28</span>, alpha=<span class=\"tk-num\">0.85</span>, label=emp)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">ax1.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set</span>(title=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Atraso na chegada</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, xlabel=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">% d</span><span class=\"tk-str\">e chegadas com atraso &gt; 15 min</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, ylabel=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">reclamações / 100 mil pax</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">ax2.<span class=\"tk-fn\">set</span>(title=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Cancelamento</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, xlabel=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">% d</span><span class=\"tk-str\">e voos cancelados</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">ax1.<span class=\"tk-fn\">legend</span>(frameon=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">fig.<span class=\"tk-fn\">suptitle</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">Reclamações por 100 mil passageiros, por companhia e mês (jan/2023 a dez/2025)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, y=<span class=\"tk-num\">1.02</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\"><span class=\"tk-fn\">fonte</span>(fig)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\">plt.<span class=\"tk-fn\">show</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\"><span class=\"tk-bi\">print</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">correlação (Pearson) com reclamações/100k: atraso = </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>painel.pct_atraso15_chegada.<span class=\"tk-fn\">corr</span>(painel.reclamacoes_100k)<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.2f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">, </span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\">      <span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">cancelamento = </span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>painel.pct_cancelados.<span class=\"tk-fn\">corr</span>(painel.reclamacoes_100k)<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.2f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><figure class=\"figura\"><button aria-label=\"Ampliar imagem: Dois gráficos de dispersão lado a lado com as reclamações por 100 mil passageiros no eixo vertical, um ponto por companhia e mês. À esquerda, contra o percentual de chegadas atrasadas: nuvem difusa, com tendência fraca. À direita, contra o percentual de cancelados: tendência crescente, com os meses de mais cancelamentos da Azul no alto à direita.\" class=\"figura__ampliar\" data-ampliar=\"\" type=\"button\"><img alt=\"Dois gráficos de dispersão lado a lado com as reclamações por 100 mil passageiros no eixo vertical, um ponto por companhia e mês. À esquerda, contra o percentual de chegadas atrasadas: nuvem difusa, com tendência fraca. À direita, contra o percentual de cancelados: tendência crescente, com os meses de mais cancelamentos da Azul no alto à direita.\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"809\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/img/estudo-de-caso/celula-061.webp\" width=\"1690\"/><span class=\"figura__icone\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"icone\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M9 21H3v-6\"></path><path d=\"m21 3-7 7\"></path><path d=\"m3 21 7-7\"></path></svg></span></button><figcaption>Fonte: ANAC (dados abertos). Elaboração própria.</figcaption></figure><pre class=\"saida__texto\" tabindex=\"0\">correlação (Pearson) com reclamações/100k: atraso = 0.30, cancelamento = 0.38</pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"secao-9-2\">9.2 Três modelos, do mais ingênuo ao mais controlado</h3>\n<p><strong>O que faz:</strong> estima quantas reclamações por 100 mil passageiros acompanham cada ponto percentual de atraso e de cancelamento.</p>\n<div aria-label=\"O que faz:\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Modelo</th>\n<th>Controles</th>\n<th>O que a variação usada representa</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>M1</td>\n<td>nenhum</td>\n<td>diferenças entre companhias e entre meses, misturadas</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M2</td>\n<td>companhia + mês do calendário + tendência linear</td>\n<td>variação dentro da companhia, já descontada a sazonalidade comum</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>M3 (principal)</td>\n<td>companhia × ano + mês do calendário</td>\n<td>variação mês a mês dentro do mesmo ano da mesma companhia</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div>\n<p>O M3 absorve choques que duram o ano inteiro numa companhia (uma recuperação judicial, uma mudança na política de reembolso, uma campanha de atendimento), que movem as reclamações sem passar pela operação.</p>\n<p>Os resíduos de meses vizinhos da mesma companhia são correlacionados (Durbin-Watson perto de 1, seção 9.3), então os erros-padrão são do tipo HAC em painel (Newey-West dentro de cada companhia, até 3 meses de defasagem), que não subestimam a incerteza como os erros comuns fariam.</p>\n<p><strong>Teste placebo:</strong> o mesmo modelo para as reclamações de <strong>cobrança</strong>, que não deveriam responder a atraso ou cancelamento no mesmo mês. Se responderem, o modelo está captando um choque comum, não o efeito da operação.</p>\n<div class=\"codigo\" data-lang=\"python\"><div class=\"codigo__barra\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><span class=\"codigo__lang\">python</span><button class=\"codigo__copiar\" data-copiar=\"\" type=\"button\">Copiar</button></div><pre aria-label=\"Código python\" class=\"codigo__pre\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"1\">formulas = {</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"2\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">M1</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{y}</span><span class=\"tk-str\"> ~ pct_atraso15_chegada + pct_cancelados</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"3\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">M2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{y}</span><span class=\"tk-str\"> ~ pct_atraso15_chegada + pct_cancelados + C(empresa) + C(mes) + I(ano * 12 + mes)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"4\">    <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">M3</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{y}</span><span class=\"tk-str\"> ~ pct_atraso15_chegada + pct_cancelados + C(empresa):C(ano) + C(mes)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"5\">}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"6\">desfechos = {<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">reclamacoes_100k</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">todas</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">reclamacoes_operacionais_100k</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">operacionais</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>,</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"7\">             <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">reclamacoes_cobranca_100k</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">cobrança (placebo)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"8\">painel = painel.<span class=\"tk-fn\">sort_values</span>([<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">empresa</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ano_mes</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>]).<span class=\"tk-fn\">reset_index</span>(drop=<span class=\"tk-kw\">True</span>)   <span class=\"tk-com\"># o HAC em painel exige a ordem</span></span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"9\">grupos = painel[<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">empresa</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>].<span class=\"tk-fn\">astype</span>(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">category</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>).cat.codes.<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_numpy</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"10\">linhas, modelos = [], {}</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"11\"><span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> y, nome_y <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> desfechos.<span class=\"tk-fn\">items</span>():</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"12\">    <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> nome_m, f <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> formulas.<span class=\"tk-fn\">items</span>():</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"13\">        m = smf.<span class=\"tk-fn\">ols</span>(f.<span class=\"tk-fn\">format</span>(y=y), painel).<span class=\"tk-fn\">fit</span>(cov_type=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">hac-panel</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, cov_kwds={<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">groups</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: grupos, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">maxlags</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-num\">3</span>})</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"14\">        modelos[(y, nome_m)] = m</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"15\">        ic = m.<span class=\"tk-fn\">conf_int</span>()</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"16\">        <span class=\"tk-kw\">for</span> x, nome_x <span class=\"tk-kw\">in</span> [(<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">pct_atraso15_chegada</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">atraso &gt; 15 min (+1 p.p.)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>), (<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">pct_cancelados</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">cancelamento (+1 p.p.)</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)]:</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"17\">            linhas.<span class=\"tk-fn\">append</span>({<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">reclamações</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: nome_y, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">modelo</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: nome_m, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">variável</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: nome_x, <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">coef</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: m.params[x],</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"18\">                           <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ic95_inf</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: ic.loc[x, <span class=\"tk-num\">0</span>], <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">ic95_sup</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: ic.loc[x, <span class=\"tk-num\">1</span>], <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">p</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: m.pvalues[x],</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"19\">                           <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">efeito_</span><span class=\"tk-str\">%</span><span class=\"tk-str\">_da_media</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: <span class=\"tk-num\">100</span> * m.params[x] / painel[y].<span class=\"tk-fn\">mean</span>(), <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">r2</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>: m.rsquared})</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"20\">coefs = pd.<span class=\"tk-fn\">DataFrame</span>(linhas)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"21\">coefs.<span class=\"tk-fn\">to_csv</span>(PASTA_AGREGADOS / <span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">regressao_coeficientes.csv</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>, index=<span class=\"tk-kw\">False</span>, float_format=<span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">%.4f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)</span>\n<span class=\"ln\" data-n=\"22\"><span class=\"tk-fn\">tabela</span>(coefs.<span class=\"tk-fn\">assign</span>(p=coefs.p.<span class=\"tk-fn\">map</span>(<span class=\"tk-kw\">lambda</span> p: <span class=\"tk-kw\">f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span><span class=\"tk-str\">{</span>p<span class=\"tk-str\">:</span><span class=\"tk-str\">.3f</span><span class=\"tk-str\">}</span><span class=\"tk-str\">'</span>)), <span class=\"tk-num\">2</span>)</span></code></pre></div>\n<div class=\"saida\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><p class=\"saida__rotulo\">Saída</p><div aria-label=\"Saída em tabela\" class=\"tabela\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"tabela-dados\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th scope=\"col\"></th>\n<th scope=\"col\">reclamações</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">modelo</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">variável</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">coef</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">ic95_inf</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">ic95_sup</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">p</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">efeito_%_da_media</th>\n<th scope=\"col\">r2</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"num\" scope=\"row\">0</th>\n<td>todas</td>\n<td>M1</td>\n<td>atraso &gt; 15 min (+1 p.p.)</td>\n<td class=\"num\">0,60</td>\n<td class=\"num\">-0,53</td>\n<td class=\"num\">1,72</td>\n<td cla